WEBVTT

00:09.137 --> 00:10.482
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.551 --> 00:12.103
kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.172 --> 00:13.655
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.724 --> 00:15.724
kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.793 --> 00:18.724
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:18.793 --> 00:20.758
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.827 --> 00:22.827
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:22.896 --> 00:24.655
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.724 --> 00:26.586
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:26.655 --> 00:28.793
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:28.862 --> 00:30.862
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:30.931 --> 00:32.758
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.827 --> 00:34.758
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.827 --> 00:36.551
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:36.620 --> 00:38.862
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.931 --> 00:40.793
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.862 --> 00:42.103
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.172 --> 00:43.965
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:44.034 --> 00:46.689
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.758 --> 00:49.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:49.068 --> 00:50.551
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:53.896 --> 00:56.793
[upbeat rock music]
[欢快的摇滚乐]

00:56.862 --> 01:03.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:03.896 --> 01:05.241
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

01:05.310 --> 01:07.241
[grunts] Mwah.
- Aww.
[咕噜声]哇。
- 哇。

01:07.310 --> 01:09.482
- [laughing]
- [笑]

01:09.551 --> 01:10.586
- Ha ha.
- 哈哈。

01:10.655 --> 01:11.931
- Ha ha.
- 哈哈。

01:12.000 --> 01:13.172
- [laughing]
- [笑]

01:13.241 --> 01:15.758
Whoa!
- [quacks]
哇！
- [庸医]

01:15.827 --> 01:18.241
- Aww.
- 哇。

01:18.310 --> 01:22.275
♪ Soon I will get a thrill,
cooking patties on my grill ♪
♪ 很快我就会感到兴奋，
在我的烤架上烤肉饼 ♪

01:22.344 --> 01:23.413
Whee!
哎哟！

01:23.482 --> 01:25.862
[grunts] Whoa!
[咕噜声]哇！

01:25.931 --> 01:29.689
"Krusty Krab closed
on account of urchins"?
“蟹堡王关门了
因为海胆”？

01:29.758 --> 01:32.206
Oh, I must be in a nightmare.
哦，我一定是在做噩梦。

01:32.275 --> 01:33.965
- It's no nightmare, SpongeBob.
- 这不是噩梦，海绵宝宝。

01:34.034 --> 01:35.827
I'm closing the old girl up
for a week
我正在关闭这个老女孩
一周

01:35.896 --> 01:37.965
to get rid
of those prickly pests.
摆脱
那些带刺的害虫。

01:38.034 --> 01:40.896
Plus, I had a coupon
for Urchin B-Gone.
另外，我有一张优惠券
对于 Urchin B-Gone。

01:40.965 --> 01:43.448
- What will become of me?
- 我会变成什么样子？

01:43.517 --> 01:47.344
What am I gonna do
for a whole week?
我要做什么
整整一周？

01:47.413 --> 01:49.000
- Slow your roll, Boy-o.
- 放慢你的滚动速度，男孩。

01:49.068 --> 01:51.586
I've rented you out
to a different establishment
我已经把你租出去了
到另一个机构

01:51.655 --> 01:53.482
for the week,
so is not to disrupt
这周，
所以不要扰乱

01:53.551 --> 01:55.000
me incomin' monies.
我有收入。

01:55.068 --> 01:56.413
- Oh, boy!
- 哦，孩子！

01:56.482 --> 01:59.862
A temporary job sounds
so adventurous.
临时工作听起来
太冒险了。

01:59.931 --> 02:01.620
Is Squidward coming too?
章鱼哥也来了？

02:01.689 --> 02:04.344
- Nope, I got him a job
in the entertainment industry.
- 不，我给他找了一份工作
在娱乐业。

02:04.413 --> 02:05.551
- Whoa.
- 哇哦。

02:05.620 --> 02:06.896
[rowdy circus music]
[horn honking]
[喧闹的马戏音乐]
[喇叭鸣响]

02:06.965 --> 02:09.068
- Still better than working
with SpongeBob.
- 还是比工作好
与海绵宝宝。

02:09.137 --> 02:10.448
- [trumpets]
- [喇叭]

02:10.517 --> 02:12.241
- Where will I be working,
Mr. Krabs?
- 我将在哪里工作，
蟹老板？

02:12.310 --> 02:15.586
- You'll be working right here
at The Salty Spitoon.
- 你将在这里工作
在咸痰盂。

02:15.655 --> 02:16.931
[yelling]
[spits]
[大喊]
[吐口水]

02:17.000 --> 02:18.482
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

02:18.551 --> 02:21.275
- No, thanks.
That place is too tough for me.
- 不，谢谢。
那个地方对我来说太难了。

02:21.344 --> 02:23.586
[screams]
- [snarls, barks]
[尖叫声]
- [咆哮，吠叫]

02:23.655 --> 02:26.137
- You don't have
to be tough to work here.
- 你没有
在这里工作很艰难。

02:26.206 --> 02:28.482
You just gotta look tough.
你只要看起来很坚强就可以了。

02:28.551 --> 02:30.448
- [grunting] There.
- [咕哝] 在那里。

02:30.517 --> 02:33.655
Now you look like a tough guy.
现在你看起来像个硬汉。

02:33.724 --> 02:35.965
- I don't feel tough,
Mr. Krabs.
- 我不觉得艰难，
蟹老板。

02:36.034 --> 02:38.758
- Now when you go in there,
go up to the biggest customer,
- 现在当你进去的时候
走到最大的客户那里，

02:38.827 --> 02:40.379
look him squarely in the eye...
[bell dings]
直视他的眼睛……
[铃声]

02:40.448 --> 02:44.206
And let him know exactly
what you think of him.
并让他确切地知道
你对他的看法。

02:44.275 --> 02:45.620
- No problem, Mr. K.
- 没问题，K先生。

02:45.689 --> 02:48.310
I'm great at looking squarely.
我很擅长直视。

02:48.379 --> 02:49.448
[laughs]
[笑]

02:49.517 --> 02:52.586
- No funny business, Boy-o.
- 没什么好笑的，男孩。

02:52.655 --> 02:55.586
[intense guitar music]
[激烈的吉他音乐]

02:55.655 --> 02:57.482
- Argh!
- Oh!
- 啊啊！
- 哦！

02:57.551 --> 03:00.517
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

03:00.586 --> 03:03.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:03.793 --> 03:05.310
- [laughs]
[cannon blows]
- [笑]
[炮声响起]

03:05.379 --> 03:11.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:11.931 --> 03:13.275
- Whoa!
- 哇！

03:13.344 --> 03:17.068
- [mumbles]
- [咕哝]

03:17.137 --> 03:18.827
- [squeaks]
- Aah!
- [吱吱声]
- 啊啊！

03:18.896 --> 03:20.310
[growls]
[咆哮]

03:20.379 --> 03:23.034
- Huh? [growls]
- 啊？ [咆哮]

03:23.103 --> 03:29.000
- Grr, I'm gonna tell you
exactly what I think of you.
- 呃，我要告诉你
这正是我对你的看法。

03:29.068 --> 03:32.517
You have got the most beautiful
baby blue eyes.
你已经拥有了最美的
淡蓝色的眼睛。

03:32.586 --> 03:34.275
- Aw, thanks.
- 哦，谢谢。

03:34.344 --> 03:36.689
I got 'em from me mother.
我从我妈妈那里得到的。

03:36.758 --> 03:39.310
- Blue eyes?
Everybody knows my green eyes
- 蓝眼睛？
每个人都知道我的绿眼睛

03:39.379 --> 03:40.482
are the most beautiful.
是最美丽的。

03:40.551 --> 03:42.379
- Oh, yeah?
- 哦，是吗？

03:42.448 --> 03:43.517
- Yeah!
- 是的！

03:43.586 --> 03:45.379
[both roaring]
[双方咆哮]

03:45.448 --> 03:47.965
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

03:48.034 --> 03:50.724
- Hey. Yai.
- 嘿。呀。

03:50.793 --> 03:53.724
- [whistles]
- You must be SpongeBob.
- [口哨]
- 你一定是海绵宝宝。

03:53.793 --> 03:57.517
Welcome to The Salty Spitoon.
[spits]
欢迎来到咸痰盂。
[吐口水]

03:57.586 --> 03:59.655
I'm the owner of this joint.
我是这家联合店的老板。

03:59.724 --> 04:03.103
That means youse works
for me now!
这意味着你可以工作
现在对我来说！

04:03.172 --> 04:04.586
- My new boss.
- 我的新老板。

04:04.655 --> 04:06.034
So nice to meet--
很高兴认识——

04:06.103 --> 04:07.206
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:07.275 --> 04:09.103
[heavy rock music]
[重摇滚]

04:09.172 --> 04:10.586
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:10.655 --> 04:12.000
- Here's the grill.
- 这是烤架。

04:12.068 --> 04:14.862
- Wha--aah. [blubbers]
- Here's the spatoola.
- 哇——啊。 [哭声]
- 这是抹刀。

04:14.931 --> 04:16.758
Now make with the grub.
- Aah.
现在用 grub 来制作。
- 啊啊。

04:16.827 --> 04:18.862
- Um, just out of curiosity,
- 嗯，只是出于好奇，

04:18.931 --> 04:21.103
uh, what happened
to your last fry cook?
呃，发生了什么事
到你最后的炒菜厨师吗？

04:21.172 --> 04:24.034
- That's our employee
of the month wall.
- 那是我们的员工
月墙。

04:24.103 --> 04:26.172
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

04:26.241 --> 04:30.793
- Your photo is gonna be next
if you don't get to work!
- 下一张就是你的照片
如果你不去上班！

04:30.862 --> 04:32.896
[smash]
- [winces]
[粉碎]
- [畏缩]

04:32.965 --> 04:34.413
[flames roaring]
[火焰咆哮]

04:34.482 --> 04:35.793
Don't worry, SpongeBob.
别担心，海绵宝宝。

04:35.862 --> 04:37.655
It'll be just like working
at the Krusty Krab.
就会像工作一样
在蟹堡王。

04:37.724 --> 04:38.793
- ♪ La la la la la ♪
- ♪ 啦啦啦啦 ♪

04:38.862 --> 04:41.137
- Keep those patties comin',
pal.
- 让那些馅饼来吧，
朋友。

04:41.206 --> 04:43.275
I love you.
我爱你。

04:43.344 --> 04:45.379
- Gimme a brick covered
in nails
- 给我一块砖盖上
在指甲里

04:45.448 --> 04:47.137
with extra motor oil!
加上额外的机油！

04:47.206 --> 04:49.793
[bell dings]
[铃声]

04:49.862 --> 04:52.931
Huh? What is this garbage?
啊？这是什么垃圾？

04:53.000 --> 04:55.931
I asked for a brick covered
with nails.
我要求盖一块砖
用指甲。

04:56.000 --> 04:59.034
- Oh, I thought
that was just diner lingo.
- 哦，我以为
那只是餐馆行话。

04:59.103 --> 05:00.448
Sorry.
[grunting]
对不起。
[咕噜声]

05:00.517 --> 05:02.620
Brick covered with nails,
extra motor oil.
砖头布满了钉子，
额外的机油。

05:02.689 --> 05:04.172
Salty Spitoon style.
咸痰盂风格。

05:04.241 --> 05:05.344
[spits]
- Hmm.
[吐口水]
- 嗯。

05:05.413 --> 05:08.344
Now that's a tough sandwich.
现在这是一个很难吃的三明治。

05:08.413 --> 05:10.310
[everyone grunting, gasping]
[每个人都咕哝着，喘着粗气]

05:10.379 --> 05:12.137
- Oh.
- 哦。

05:14.103 --> 05:19.655
- Ooh, the brick is so tender,
and the nails are roasted.
- 哦，砖块太嫩了，
指甲被烤了。

05:19.724 --> 05:22.206
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

05:22.275 --> 05:24.413
- Whoo-hoo!
- Got some more orders for you,
- 呼呼！
- 还有一些订单要给你，

05:24.482 --> 05:25.965
SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。

05:26.034 --> 05:29.310
- 72 bricks covered
in motor oil coming right up.
- 覆盖 72 块砖块
机油马上就出来了。

05:29.379 --> 05:31.206
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

05:31.275 --> 05:33.000
[cheering]
[欢呼]

05:35.000 --> 05:36.137
[all gasp]
- Whaddaya know?
[全都喘气]
- 你知道什么？

05:36.206 --> 05:38.379
Whaddaya say, gang?
帮派，说什么？

05:38.448 --> 05:39.896
- It's Puff the Tuff!
- [gasps]
- 这是凝灰岩泡芙！
- [喘气]

05:39.965 --> 05:42.275
[stuttering] Puff the Tuff?
[结巴] 凝灰岩？

05:42.344 --> 05:44.241
[straining]
- [grunts]
[紧张]
- [咕哝]

05:44.310 --> 05:47.000
[laughs]
[笑]

05:48.344 --> 05:49.275
[inhales]
[吸气]

05:49.344 --> 05:51.172
[all groan]
[全都呻吟]

05:51.241 --> 05:54.206
- Gimme a tall glass
of broken glass
- 给我一个高脚杯
碎玻璃的

05:54.275 --> 05:56.206
in a dirty glass.
在脏玻璃杯中。

05:56.275 --> 05:57.517
[glass shatters]
[玻璃碎裂]

05:57.586 --> 05:59.000
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

05:59.068 --> 06:00.448
[chomp]
[咀嚼]

06:00.517 --> 06:02.724
- [laughing]
- [笑]

06:02.793 --> 06:04.551
- That laugh. No!
- 那笑声。不！

06:04.620 --> 06:05.793
It can't be him.
不可能是他。

06:05.862 --> 06:08.034
- Who ordered the bomb-becue?
- 谁下令制造炸弹？

06:08.103 --> 06:09.448
[laughs]
[笑]

06:09.517 --> 06:11.068
- SpongeBob!
- [gasps]
- 海绵宝宝！
- [喘气]

06:11.137 --> 06:13.965
- [groans] Aah!
- [呻吟]啊啊！

06:14.034 --> 06:15.241
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

06:15.310 --> 06:17.241
- Was that Mrs. Puff?
- 那是帕夫夫人吗？

06:17.310 --> 06:18.896
- Wait a second.
- 等一下。

06:18.965 --> 06:21.931
Why is Puff the Tuff afraid
of you?
凝灰岩帕夫为什么害怕
你的？

06:22.000 --> 06:23.827
- Oh, she probably
didn't recognize me
- 哦，她可能
没认出我

06:23.896 --> 06:26.000
now that I'm a tough guy.
现在我是一个硬汉了。

06:26.068 --> 06:28.448
[horn honks]
Oh, my shoelace is untied.
[喇叭鸣响]
哦，我的鞋带松了。

06:28.517 --> 06:29.931
Safety first.
[boom]
安全第一。
[繁荣]

06:30.000 --> 06:32.344
- Aah!
- That new little cook
- 啊啊！
- 那个新来的小厨师

06:32.413 --> 06:33.793
seems pretty tough.
看起来相当艰难。

06:33.862 --> 06:37.241
- Oh, yeah?
Let's see how tough he is.
- 哦，是吗？
让我们看看他有多坚强。

06:37.310 --> 06:42.310
Let the trials
of toughness begin!
让考验
韧性开始！

06:42.379 --> 06:44.620
Mechanical Sea-bull.
机械海牛。

06:44.689 --> 06:47.413
- Whoa! Whoa! Aah!
- 哇！哇！啊啊！

06:47.482 --> 06:49.241
- Aw, poor thing.
- 噢，可怜的东西。

06:49.310 --> 06:52.310
You're probably tired of people
riding you all the time.
你可能厌倦了人们
一直骑着你。

06:52.379 --> 06:53.965
Take a break and ride me.
休息一下，骑我吧。

06:54.034 --> 06:56.137
- [snorts]
- [laughs]
- [哼哼]
- [笑]

06:56.206 --> 06:57.241
Whee!
[smash]
哎哟！
[粉碎]

06:57.310 --> 07:00.241
Oops.
哎呀。

07:00.310 --> 07:02.793
- Whoo-hoo. Whoo-hoo.
- 呼呼。呼呼。

07:02.862 --> 07:04.310
- Punching bag!
- 出气筒！

07:04.379 --> 07:07.379
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:07.448 --> 07:08.689
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

07:08.758 --> 07:11.344
Whoa.
哇哦。

07:11.413 --> 07:13.724
[air squeaking]
[空气吱吱声]

07:13.793 --> 07:15.758
- Nice punch, SpongeBob.
- 海绵宝宝，一拳打得好。

07:15.827 --> 07:18.586
- Body hair strength!
- 体毛强度！

07:18.655 --> 07:20.172
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

07:20.241 --> 07:21.689
[laughs]
[笑]

07:23.068 --> 07:24.965
- Uh.
- 呃。

07:25.034 --> 07:26.482
Oh.
哦。

07:26.551 --> 07:28.620
I'll just use my abrasive side.
我只用我的磨料面。

07:28.689 --> 07:31.137
[laughs]
[笑]

07:31.206 --> 07:34.620
- [gasps] Aww.
- [喘气] 哇。

07:34.689 --> 07:39.931
- I declare the toughest guy
at The Salty Spitoon...
- 我宣布最强硬汉
在咸痰盂...

07:40.000 --> 07:44.241
[spits]
Is SpongeBob SquarePants.
[吐口水]
是海绵宝宝。

07:44.310 --> 07:46.586
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

07:46.655 --> 07:48.310
[chain clangs]
[链条叮当作响]

07:48.379 --> 07:49.517
Whoo!
呼！

07:49.586 --> 07:52.172
- As our tough guy leader,
- 作为我们的硬汉领袖，

07:52.241 --> 07:57.103
you have the power
to do whatever you want.
你有权力
做任何你想做的事。

07:57.172 --> 08:00.586
- Well, in that case,
I've got a few wild ideas
- 那么，在这种情况下，
我有一些疯狂的想法

08:00.655 --> 08:02.000
for this place.
对于这个地方。

08:04.206 --> 08:05.482
[all quacking]
[都嘎嘎叫]

08:05.551 --> 08:07.344
[motor roars]
[马达轰鸣声]

08:08.827 --> 08:11.689
[upbeat rock music]
[欢快的摇滚乐]

08:11.758 --> 08:13.965
[motor revs]
[电机转速]

08:14.034 --> 08:15.620
[horn honks]
- Aah!
[喇叭鸣响]
- 啊啊！

08:15.689 --> 08:20.793
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:20.862 --> 08:22.931
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

08:23.000 --> 08:24.724
- All right, guys.
- 好吧，伙计们。

08:24.793 --> 08:27.517
Prepare to rumble
in the toughest place
准备隆隆作响
在最艰难的地方

08:27.586 --> 08:29.310
in Bikini Bottom.
在比基尼底部。

08:29.379 --> 08:31.689
[cheering]
[欢呼]

08:31.758 --> 08:33.586
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

08:33.655 --> 08:35.793
Huh? [growls]
啊？ [咆哮]

08:35.862 --> 08:38.793
[light music]
[轻音乐]

08:38.862 --> 08:46.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:50.068 --> 08:51.862
Yeah, no, no, no, no.
This is the right place.
是的，不，不，不，不。
这是正确的地方。

08:51.931 --> 08:53.896
What's going on in here?
这里发生了什么事？

08:53.965 --> 08:56.896
I demand to speak
to whoever's in charge.
我要求发言
给负责的人。

08:56.965 --> 09:00.620
[patrons quietly conversing]
[顾客小声交谈]

09:00.689 --> 09:03.620
[old Western music playing]
[古老的西洋音乐演奏]

09:03.689 --> 09:05.275
- Welcome, stranger.
- 欢迎，陌生人。

09:05.344 --> 09:06.931
- Oh. [chuckles]
- 哦。 [笑声]

09:07.000 --> 09:08.413
Why is the cheese talking
to me?
奶酪为什么会说话
对我来说？

09:08.482 --> 09:12.034
- You asked to speak
with the tough leader?
- 你要求发言
与强硬的领导者？

09:12.103 --> 09:14.862
- No, no, really, who let
this guy in here?
- 不，不，真的，谁让
这家伙在这儿吗？

09:14.931 --> 09:18.862
- I see you're admiring
the new décor.
- 我看你很欣赏
新的装饰。

09:18.931 --> 09:20.931
- Tell him how it is, lad.
- 告诉他是怎么回事，小伙子。

09:21.000 --> 09:23.724
- I'll do him one better.
- 我会让他做得更好。

09:23.793 --> 09:24.965
♪ Oh ♪
♪ 噢 ♪

09:25.034 --> 09:26.965
all: ♪ Oh ♪
全体：♪哦♪

09:27.034 --> 09:30.689
- Hey, what's happening?
- 嘿，发生什么事了？

09:30.758 --> 09:32.793
♪ Come one and come all
to The Softy Spitoon ♪
♪ Come one and come all
到软痰盂♪

09:32.862 --> 09:34.862
all: ♪ Softy Spitoon ♪
全部： ♪ 软痰盂 ♪

09:34.931 --> 09:37.000
- ♪ Where all of our cupcakes
come with a balloon ♪
- ♪ 我们所有的纸杯蛋糕都在那里
带着气球来吧♪

09:37.068 --> 09:39.275
all: ♪ Softy Spitoon ♪
全部： ♪ 软痰盂 ♪

09:39.344 --> 09:41.034
- If you like head kisses
and cuddly hugs ♪
- 如果你喜欢吻头
和可爱的拥抱♪

09:41.103 --> 09:43.448
all: ♪ Softy Spitoon ♪
全部： ♪ 软痰盂 ♪

09:43.517 --> 09:45.551
- ♪ And raise up your milk
with "I heart Mom" mugs ♪
- ♪ 并提高你的牛奶
带着“我心妈妈”马克杯♪

09:45.620 --> 09:47.793
all: ♪ Softy Spitoon ♪
- ♪ Ready? ♪
全部： ♪ 软痰盂 ♪
- ♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

09:47.862 --> 09:50.034
all: ♪ Softy ♪
- Enough!
全部：♪ 软软的 ♪
- 够了！

09:50.103 --> 09:54.344
You're acting like a bunch
of weenies.
你们表现得像一群人
的小威尼。

09:54.413 --> 09:55.896
- Weenies?
- 维尼？

09:55.965 --> 09:58.965
We have those,
and they are to die for.
我们有那些，
他们是值得为之而死的。

09:59.034 --> 10:02.379
A dab of freshly pickled
relish, perhaps?
一点新鲜腌制的
也许喜欢？

10:02.448 --> 10:04.448
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

10:04.517 --> 10:06.310
- [cries]
- Hey!
- [哭声]
- 嘿！

10:06.379 --> 10:08.413
There ain't no cryin'
in The Softy--
没有哭泣
在《软软》中——

10:08.482 --> 10:10.724
I mean The Salty Spitoon.
我指的是咸痰盂。

10:10.793 --> 10:13.068
- Well, there is now,
buttercup.
- 嗯，现在有，
毛茛。

10:13.137 --> 10:16.413
And if you don't like it,
you can hike it.
如果你不喜欢它，
你可以徒步旅行。

10:16.482 --> 10:18.551
- Oh, yeah?
- 哦，是吗？

10:18.620 --> 10:20.689
- Yeah.
- [snaps]
- 是的。
- [快照]

10:20.758 --> 10:23.862
[everyone yelling]
[大家大喊]

10:24.551 --> 10:28.034
- Well, let's see
how SpongeBob is doing.
- 好吧，让我们看看
海绵宝宝现在怎么样了。

10:28.103 --> 10:29.620
This oughta be good.
[glass shatters]
这个应该不错吧
[玻璃碎裂]

10:29.689 --> 10:31.689
[gasps]
[喘气]

10:31.758 --> 10:33.931
- Krabs,
what are you doin' here?
- 螃蟹，
你在这里做什么？

10:34.000 --> 10:35.517
The week ain't up yet.
这周还没到呢

10:35.586 --> 10:37.896
- SpongeBob isn't giving you
a problem?
- 海绵宝宝不会给你
有问题吗？

10:37.965 --> 10:39.172
- Problem?
- 问题？

10:39.241 --> 10:42.896
Nah, he's the belle
of the ball.
不，他是美女
球的。

10:42.965 --> 10:45.275
- [chomps] Ah.
[groans]
- [咀嚼]啊。
[呻吟]

10:45.344 --> 10:48.275
- In fact,
the customers like him so much,
- 事实上，
顾客非常喜欢他，

10:48.344 --> 10:51.344
I'm gonna keep him
on permanently.
我要留住他
永久开启。

10:51.413 --> 10:52.793
- You can't do that.
- 你不能那样做。

10:52.862 --> 10:55.241
He's coming back
with me right now.
他回来了
现在就和我在一起。

10:55.310 --> 10:56.655
- Oh, yeah?
- 哦，是吗？

10:56.724 --> 10:58.620
- Yeah.
- 是的。

10:58.689 --> 11:01.448
[gasps]
[both grunting]
[喘气]
[两人都咕哝着]

11:01.517 --> 11:03.448
- I better take you home,
Mr. Krabs.
- 我最好带你回家
蟹老板。

11:03.517 --> 11:06.034
This place is much too tough
for you.
这个地方太难了
为了你。

11:06.103 --> 11:08.413
You might get hurt, see?
你可能会受伤，明白吗？

11:08.482 --> 11:09.620
- Whoa.
- Ha.
- 哇哦。
- 哈。

11:09.689 --> 11:12.241
- Fare thee well,
you old Softy Spitoon.
- 再见，
你这个老软痰盂。

11:12.310 --> 11:14.448
We'll always have...
[spits]
我们永远都会有...
[吐口水]

11:14.517 --> 11:16.793
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

11:16.862 --> 11:19.206
Huh? Hey, everybody.
啊？嘿，大家。

11:19.275 --> 11:22.000
That guy is kidnapping
our leader.
那家伙正在绑架
我们的领袖。

11:22.068 --> 11:23.896
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

11:23.965 --> 11:25.931
- ♪ Softy Spitoon ♪
- ♪ 软痰盂 ♪

11:26.000 --> 11:27.862
♪ Softy Spitoon ♪
♪ 软痰盂 ♪

11:27.931 --> 11:29.517
♪ Softy ♪
♪ 柔软 ♪

11:29.586 --> 11:33.448
♪ Spitoon ♪
♪ 痰盂 ♪

11:33.517 --> 11:34.551
[laughs]
[笑]

[笑]